2026 World Cup Hero Roster: Country Assignments
Since the 2026 World Cup features 48 nations across 12 groups, I’ve assigned your 133 MLBB-style heroes to the country they’d be best suited for—based on explicit ethnicity, cultural theme, climate, architecture, or fighting aesthetic. Where no exact match exists, I used the closest cultural proxy (e.g., Chinese-coded heroes → South Korea, as the nearest East Asian representative; Norse → Norway/Sweden; Desert → Gulf/North African nations).

